## �️ Kiến trúc & Phạm vi

### Core Platform (Giữ nguyên)
- ✅ Microservices: API Gateway, Orchestrator, Project Service, Webhook Service, Log Streamer
- ✅ Message Queue: RabbitMQ
- ✅ Database: PostgreSQL
- ✅ Build Pipeline: Cloud Native Buildpacks

### Mở rộng (Technical Focus)
- 🔧 Control Plane / Data Plane separation
- 🔧 Multi-tenant isolation với Kubernetes namespaces
- 🔧 Observability stack (OpenTelemetry, Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Tempo)
- 🔧 Progressive Delivery (Canary, Blue/Green)
- 🔧 Autoscaling & ML-based scheduler
- 🔧 High Availability & Disaster Recovery
- 🔧 Security hardening (image scanning, SBOM, signing)
- 🔧 Performance optimization (caching, batching, resource pooling)

---

## 📅 QUÝ 1 (Tháng 0-3): Core Infrastructure

### Mục tiêu Quý
**Xây dựng nền tảng vững chắc: tách biệt Control/Data plane, cải thiện reliability, setup observability đầy đủ**

---

### Epic 1.1: Control Plane / Data Plane Separation
**Timeline:** Tuần 1-4 | **Priority:** P0 (Critical)

#### Tasks
1. **Tách logic Control Plane**
   - **Làm gì:** Refactor Orchestrator để tách logic quản lý (scheduling, resource allocation) ra khỏi execution logic
   - **Output:** 
     - Control Plane service chạy riêng (REST API + gRPC cho internal calls)
     - Data Plane agents chạy trên từng cluster (execute actual deployments)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Zero downtime khi deploy Control Plane updates
     - Control Plane latency < 100ms (p95) cho API calls
     - Data Plane có thể scale độc lập (test 1-10 clusters)

2. **Implement gRPC cho internal communication**
   - **Làm gì:** Thay thế HTTP calls giữa Orchestrator và K8s operations bằng gRPC
   - **Output:** 
     - Protocol buffers định nghĩa cho tất cả internal services
     - gRPC server/client implementation với streaming support
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Latency giảm 40% so với HTTP (baseline test)
     - Support bi-directional streaming cho logs và metrics
     - Connection pool reuse rate ≥ 90%

3. **State Management với PostgreSQL**
   - **Làm gì:** Centralize state trong PostgreSQL với ACID guarantees
   - **Output:**
     - Schema migration cho deployment states, task queues, locks
     - Optimistic locking cho concurrent operations
     - Event sourcing table cho audit trail
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Zero state inconsistencies (integration test suite)
     - Database query time p95 < 50ms
     - Support ≥ 1000 concurrent deployments

---

### Epic 1.2: Reliability & Resilience
**Timeline:** Tuần 3-6 | **Priority:** P0

#### Tasks
1. **Idempotency Keys Implementation**
   - **Làm gì:** Implement idempotency cho tất cả mutating operations (deploy, scale, delete)
   - **Output:**
     - Idempotency middleware với key generation (hash của request body + nonce)
     - Redis-backed deduplication cache (TTL 24h)
     - Automatic retry với exponential backoff
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% duplicate requests detected và deduplicated
     - Zero double-deployments trong chaos test (1000 concurrent retries)
     - Cache hit rate ≥ 85%

2. **Circuit Breakers & Retries**
   - **Làm gì:** Add circuit breaker pattern cho tất cả external calls (K8s API, Git, Registry)
   - **Output:**
     - Circuit breaker library integration (Opossum/Hystrix-like)
     - Configurable thresholds (failure rate, timeout, half-open state)
     - Fallback strategies per operation type
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Prevent cascading failures (kill K8s API → system recovers in < 30s)
     - Automatic recovery khi downstream available
     - Failed request rate < 0.1% trong normal operation

3. **Dead Letter Queue (DLQ)**
   - **Làm gì:** Setup DLQ cho RabbitMQ để handle failed messages
   - **Output:**
     - DLQ configuration với automatic retry (3 attempts, exponential backoff)
     - Dead letter routing cho từng queue type
     - DLQ monitoring dashboard và alert rules
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% failed messages captured
     - Automatic replay functionality với manual approval
     - DLQ size alert trigger khi > 100 messages

4. **Health Checks & Liveness Probes**
   - **Làm gì:** Implement comprehensive health checks cho tất cả services
   - **Output:**
     - `/health` endpoint với dependency checks (DB, RabbitMQ, Redis)
     - `/ready` endpoint cho K8s readiness probe
     - `/metrics` endpoint (Prometheus format)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Health check latency < 10ms
     - Automatic pod restart khi unhealthy
     - Zero traffic to unhealthy pods (verified với load test)

---

### Epic 1.3: Observability Stack
**Timeline:** Tuần 5-10 | **Priority:** P0

#### Tasks
1. **OpenTelemetry Integration**
   - **Làm gì:** Instrument tất cả services với OpenTelemetry (traces, metrics, logs)
   - **Output:**
     - Auto-instrumentation cho Express.js/Fastify apps
     - Custom spans cho business logic (deploy, build, scale operations)
     - Trace context propagation qua RabbitMQ và gRPC
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% requests traced với unique trace-id
     - Trace sampling rate: 100% errors, 10% success (configurable)
     - End-to-end trace latency overhead < 5ms

2. **Prometheus + Grafana Setup**
   - **Làm gì:** Deploy Prometheus stack và pre-built dashboards
   - **Output:**
     - Prometheus deployment với service discovery
     - Grafana dashboards: System Overview, Service Detail, SLI/SLO tracking
     - Alert rules (yaml-based, version controlled)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Metrics scrape interval: 15s
     - Metric retention: 30 days
     - Query response time p95 < 500ms
     - Alert firing latency < 1 minute

3. **Loki for Log Aggregation**
   - **Làm gì:** Deploy Loki và integrate với tất cả services
   - **Output:**
     - Loki deployment với S3/MinIO backend
     - Promtail agents trên tất cả nodes
     - LogQL queries cho common patterns
     - Log retention policy (7 days debug, 30 days info, 90 days error)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Log ingestion rate ≥ 10K logs/sec
     - Log search latency p95 < 2s
     - Log storage compression ratio ≥ 5:1

4. **Tempo for Distributed Tracing**
   - **Làm gì:** Deploy Tempo backend cho trace storage
   - **Output:**
     - Tempo deployment với object storage backend
     - Integration với Grafana (trace visualization)
     - Trace sampling strategies (head-based + tail-based)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Trace ingestion rate ≥ 1K traces/sec
     - Trace storage cost < $100/TB/month
     - Trace query latency p95 < 3s

5. **Custom Dashboards**
   - **Làm gì:** Build operational dashboards cho platform team
   - **Output:**
     - **System Overview:** CPU/Mem/Disk per node, pod count, deployment frequency
     - **Service Detail:** Per-service latency/throughput/error rate, resource usage
     - **Build Pipeline:** Build duration, success rate, queue length
     - **SLI/SLO Tracking:** Availability, latency, error budget burn rate
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Dashboard load time < 1s
     - Auto-refresh interval: 10s
     - 100% of key metrics covered

---

### Epic 1.4: Database Optimization
**Timeline:** Tuần 8-12 | **Priority:** P1

#### Tasks
1. **Index Optimization**
   - **Làm gì:** Analyze query patterns và add indexes
   - **Output:**
     - B-tree indexes cho foreign keys và lookup columns
     - Partial indexes cho filtered queries (e.g., status='running')
     - Analyze explain plans cho top 20 slowest queries
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Query time giảm ≥ 60% cho top queries
     - Index hit ratio ≥ 99%
     - No sequential scans on large tables (> 10K rows)

2. **Connection Pooling**
   - **Làm gì:** Implement proper connection pooling với pgBouncer
   - **Output:**
     - PgBouncer deployment (transaction pooling mode)
     - Pool size tuning (min 10, max 100, idle timeout 30s)
     - Connection metrics monitoring
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Connection pool saturation < 80%
     - Connection acquire time p95 < 5ms
     - Zero "too many connections" errors

3. **Read Replicas**
   - **Làm gì:** Setup PostgreSQL read replicas cho read-heavy queries
   - **Output:**
     - 2x read replicas với streaming replication
     - Read/write splitting trong application layer
     - Replica lag monitoring
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Read queries offloaded ≥ 70%
     - Replica lag p95 < 1s
     - Automatic failover tested (< 10s downtime)

---

### Epic 1.5: Build Pipeline Optimization
**Timeline:** Tuần 9-12 | **Priority:** P1

#### Tasks
1. **Build Cache Layer**
   - **Làm gì:** Implement multi-layer caching cho builds
   - **Output:**
     - Registry layer caching (Docker registry mirror/Harbor)
     - Buildpack cache volumes (persistent across builds)
     - Dependency cache (npm/pip/go modules)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Cache hit rate ≥ 70%
     - Build time reduction ≥ 50% với cache
     - Cache size < 500GB (automatic cleanup)

2. **Parallel Build Execution**
   - **Làm gì:** Support concurrent builds với resource isolation
   - **Output:**
     - Build queue với priority scheduling
     - Resource limits per build (CPU, memory, disk)
     - Build cancellation support
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Support ≥ 10 concurrent builds
     - Build queue latency p95 < 30s
     - Zero build resource interference

3. **Build Metrics & Monitoring**
   - **Làm gì:** Instrument build pipeline với metrics
   - **Output:**
     - Build duration histogram per language/framework
     - Build success rate per repo
     - Resource usage per build
     - Build queue depth real-time metric
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% builds tracked
     - Build failure alert within 1 minute
     - Build analytics dashboard live

---

