| Metric | Target | Measurement Method |
|--------|--------|-------------------|
| Control Plane API latency (p95) | < 100ms | Prometheus histogram |
| Data Plane deployment latency (p95) | < 5min | End-to-end trace |
| System uptime | ≥ 99.5% | Uptime monitoring |
| Failed deployment rate | < 1% | Deployment success counter |
| Build cache hit rate | ≥ 70% | Build logs analysis |
| Database query time (p95) | < 50ms | pg_stat_statements |
| Idempotency dedup rate | 100% | Redis cache metrics |
| Log ingestion rate | ≥ 10K/sec | Loki metrics |
| Trace sampling coverage | 100% errors + 10% success | Tempo metrics |
| Circuit breaker prevention | 0 cascading failures | Chaos test results |

