## 📅 QUÝ 2 (Tháng 4-6): Multi-tenant & Security

### Mục tiêu Quý
**Xây dựng multi-tenant isolation hoàn chỉnh, hardening security với image scanning/signing, và progressive delivery**

---

### Epic 2.1: Multi-tenant Namespace Isolation
**Timeline:** Tuần 13-18 | **Priority:** P0

#### Tasks
1. **Namespace Provisioning System**
   - **Làm gì:** Auto-provisioning isolated namespaces cho mỗi tenant
   - **Output:**
     - Namespace template với labels và annotations
     - Automatic NetworkPolicy injection
     - Resource quota templates (3 tiers: small/medium/large)
     - LimitRange templates (default request/limits)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Namespace creation time < 5s
     - 100% namespaces có NetworkPolicy applied
     - Zero cross-namespace traffic (verified với network probe tests)

2. **ResourceQuota Enforcement**
   - **Làm gì:** Implement quota system với soft/hard limits
   - **Output:**
     - Quota controller monitoring usage real-time
     - Automatic pod eviction khi exceed hard limits
     - Warning alerts at 80% soft limit
     - Quota API endpoint (GET /quotas/:tenantId/usage)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Quota enforcement latency < 1s
     - Zero over-quota deployments
     - Quota metrics accuracy ±2%

3. **NetworkPolicy Templates**
   - **Làm gì:** Define và auto-apply network policies
   - **Output:**
     - Default deny all ingress/egress
     - Allowlist policies (DNS, external APIs, ingress controller)
     - Per-service custom policies (database, cache access)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% pods covered by NetworkPolicy
     - Zero unauthorized network connections (verified với Cilium Hubble)
     - Policy evaluation latency < 1ms

4. **Pod Security Standards**
   - **Làm gì:** Enforce Pod Security Standards (restricted profile)
   - **Output:**
     - PodSecurityPolicy/PodSecurity admission config
     - Restricted profile: no privileged, no host network, read-only root fs
     - Security context templates
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% pods comply với restricted profile
     - Zero privilege escalation vulnerabilities
     - Automatic rejection của non-compliant pods

---

### Epic 2.2: Security & Supply Chain
**Timeline:** Tuần 15-22 | **Priority:** P0

#### Tasks
1. **Image Scanning Pipeline**
   - **Làm gì:** Integrate Trivy/Grype vào build pipeline
   - **Output:**
     - Pre-push scanning (fail build nếu critical CVEs)
     - Runtime scanning (scheduled daily scans)
     - CVE database auto-update
     - Vulnerability report API endpoint
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% images scanned before deployment
     - Critical CVE detection rate: 100% (verified với known vulnerable images)
     - Scan time < 30s per image
     - False positive rate < 5%

2. **SBOM Generation**
   - **Làm gì:** Generate Software Bill of Materials cho mọi build
   - **Output:**
     - Syft integration trong build pipeline
     - SBOM format: SPDX JSON và CycloneDX
     - SBOM storage trong artifact registry
     - SBOM API endpoint (GET /sbom/:imageId)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% images có SBOM
     - SBOM generation time < 10s
     - SBOM completeness: ≥ 95% dependencies detected

3. **Image Signing với Cosign**
   - **Làm gì:** Sign tất cả images với Cosign
   - **Output:**
     - Key management system (Vault hoặc KMS)
     - Automatic signing sau successful build + scan
     - Signature verification trong admission controller
     - Signature API endpoint
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% production images signed
     - Signature verification time < 100ms
     - Zero unsigned images deployed (enforced)

4. **Admission Controller cho Verification**
   - **Làm gì:** Deploy admission webhook để verify signatures + scan results
   - **Output:**
     - ValidatingWebhook configuration
     - Signature verification logic
     - CVE threshold checking (block critical, warn high)
     - Audit logging cho all admission decisions
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% deployments verified
     - Admission latency < 200ms
     - Zero bypass cases

5. **Secrets Management với Vault**
   - **Làm gì:** Integrate HashiCorp Vault + External Secrets Operator
   - **Output:**
     - Vault deployment (HA mode)
     - External Secrets Operator installation
     - Secret rotation policies (30-day rotation)
     - Secret injection via CSI driver
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Zero plaintext secrets trong Git/DB
     - Secret rotation success rate 100%
     - Secret access latency < 50ms

---

### Epic 2.3: Progressive Delivery
**Timeline:** Tuần 19-24 | **Priority:** P1

#### Tasks
1. **Argo Rollouts Integration**
   - **Làm gì:** Deploy Argo Rollouts cho canary/blue-green deployments
   - **Output:**
     - Argo Rollouts controller installation
     - Rollout CRD templates (canary strategy default)
     - Rollout API endpoint (POST /rollout/:serviceId)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Support canary với traffic splitting (10%, 25%, 50%, 100%)
     - Support blue-green với automatic promotion
     - Rollout orchestration latency < 5s per step

2. **SLO-based Automatic Rollback**
   - **Làm gì:** Implement rollback logic based on metrics
   - **Output:**
     - SLO definition templates (error rate < 1%, latency p95 < 500ms)
     - Prometheus query integration
     - Automatic rollback trigger
     - Rollback notification (Slack, webhook)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Rollback decision latency < 30s
     - False positive rollback rate < 2%
     - Rollback execution time < 2min

3. **Traffic Splitting với Service Mesh**
   - **Làm gì:** Deploy Linkerd cho fine-grained traffic control
   - **Output:**
     - Linkerd installation (control plane + data plane proxies)
     - TrafficSplit CRD configuration
     - Metrics integration (Linkerd → Prometheus)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Traffic split accuracy ±1%
     - Proxy latency overhead < 1ms p95
     - Zero traffic loss during split changes

4. **Rollout Metrics & Analysis**
   - **Làm gì:** Build analytics cho rollout performance
   - **Output:**
     - Rollout duration tracking
     - Rollout success rate metrics
     - Analysis report (comparison baseline vs canary)
     - Rollout dashboard trong Grafana
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - 100% rollouts tracked
     - Analysis completion time < 10s
     - Report accuracy: statistical significance p < 0.05

---

### Epic 2.4: Resource Metering & Quotas
**Timeline:** Tuần 20-24 | **Priority:** P1

#### Tasks
1. **Usage Collector**
   - **Làm gì:** Build real-time resource usage collector
   - **Output:**
     - Prometheus queries cho CPU-seconds, Memory-GB-hours
     - Aggregation service (per-tenant, per-service, per-day)
     - Time-series database (TimescaleDB extension)
     - Usage API endpoint (GET /usage/:tenantId?start=&end=)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Data collection interval: 1 minute
     - Data retention: 90 days
     - Query latency p95 < 500ms
     - Accuracy ±3% (compared to K8s metrics-server)

2. **Quota API & Enforcement**
   - **Làm gì:** Build API để manage và enforce quotas
   - **Output:**
     - Quota CRUD API (POST/GET/PATCH /quotas/:tenantId)
     - Real-time quota checking before deployment
     - Quota exceeded webhook (block deployment)
     - Quota reset scheduler (monthly/daily)
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Quota check latency < 50ms
     - 100% quota violations prevented
     - Zero false negatives

3. **Cost Attribution**
   - **Làm gì:** Calculate cost per tenant based on usage
   - **Output:**
     - Cost model configuration (per-CPU-hour, per-GB-hour, egress per GB)
     - Cost calculation engine
     - Cost report generation
     - Cost breakdown dashboard
   - **KPI hoàn thành:**
     - Cost calculation accuracy ±5%
     - Report generation time < 5s
     - Support 1000+ tenants

